    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>[Saechsisch] User Guide</label><div><h5>[Saechsisch] Overview</h5><ul><li>[Saechsisch] Start page with search, favorites, to-do, notes, weather, news.</li><li>[Saechsisch] All local: data stays in your browser (localStorage).</li></ul><h5>[Saechsisch] Shortcuts</h5><ul><li>[Saechsisch] Ctrl/Cmd+K: open command palette</li><li>[Saechsisch] 1-9: open first 9 favorites (when not typing)</li><li>[Saechsisch] / : focus search (also via palette)</li><li>[Saechsisch] Enter in search: start search</li><li>[Saechsisch] ESC: close modals</li><li>[Saechsisch] Palette: quick actions for widgets, theme, background, data, favorites</li><li>[Saechsisch] Palette: key C switches card style, \"Reset header colors\" resets search & clock</li></ul><h5>[Saechsisch] Search & Autocomplete</h5><ul><li>[Saechsisch] Bangs: !g[Saechsisch]  !ddg[Saechsisch]  !bing[Saechsisch]  !yt[Saechsisch]  !wiki[Saechsisch]  !maps</li><li>[Saechsisch] Custom shortcuts: JSON in settings; {q}[Saechsisch]  as placeholder</li><li>[Saechsisch] Autocomplete: bangs, shortcuts, recent searches, wordlist (global + preset)</li><li>[Saechsisch] Tab accepts suggestion, Enter starts search</li></ul><h5>[Saechsisch] Tiles</h5><ul><li>[Saechsisch] Drag & drop to sort, click to open</li><li>[Saechsisch] + Tile: add a new favorite</li><li>[Saechsisch] Reset: restore default favorites</li></ul><h5>[Saechsisch] Widgets & Layout</h5><ul><li>[Saechsisch] Visibility per widget</li><li>[Saechsisch] Card style is global (glass, solid, transparent, soft minimal)</li><li>[Saechsisch] Custom colors for clock/search; reset restores style defaults</li><li>[Saechsisch] Widget colors & \"Tint widgets\" set the accent per card</li></ul><h5>[Saechsisch] Background</h5><ul><li>[Saechsisch] Presets, uploads, collections, rotation (time/theme/interval)</li><li>[Saechsisch] Accent color is extracted from the active background</li></ul><h5>[Saechsisch] Data</h5><ul><li>[Saechsisch] Export/Import as JSON</li><li>[Saechsisch] Load data presets (assets/presets/*.json in the repo)</li></ul><h5>Startpage Agent</h5><ul><li>Integrated AI chat with local Ollama (host/model in settings).</li><li>Supports streaming responses, stop (button/ESC), persistent history, and Markdown.</li><li>Agentic tools can read/change widgets and settings (depending on confirm mode).</li></ul></div></div>",
    "general": {
      "agentLabel": "Startpage Agent",
      "agentEnabled": "Agent aktiv",
      "agentHint": "Wenn deaktiviert, wird nichts an Ollama gesendet."
    }
